  "$comment": "ESP32 DevKit (WROOM-32) GPIO capability table. Single source of truth for the web app and validate_project.py. Only GPIOs that physically exist are listed: 0-19, 21-23, 25-27, 32-39. GPIOs 20, 24, 28-31 do not exist on this chip and are intentionally omitted.",
